{
  "_comment": "内建导航与注册表的跨语言对拍用例（ADR 0020 第 3 条、0050 决策 1）。消费者：engines/novaact/tests/test_deterministic.py 与 engines/midscene/src/worker/deterministic.test.mts，两侧读同一个文件。cases：两个引擎的 ADDRESS_PATTERN 对每条 text 须给出相同的命中结果，命中时 url 组相同，hit 为 false 的文本走 AI。registry：清空注册表后按顺序注册 entries，清单的 keywords 与 matchBatch 对 probes 的回答两侧须一致；pattern 用 Python 具名组写法，JS 侧把 (?P< 换成 (?<；<NAV> 指内建导航的 ADDRESS_PATTERN。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "text": "\"https://www.wikipedia.org/\"",
      "hit": true,
      "url": "https://www.wikipedia.org/"
    },
    {
      "text": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OpenAI",
      "hit": true,
      "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OpenAI"
    },
    {
      "text": "  \"https://example.com/a?b=1&c=2#x\"  ",
      "hit": true,
      "url": "https://example.com/a?b=1&c=2#x"
    },
    {
      "text": "\thttps://example.com/\t",
      "hit": true,
      "url": "https://example.com/",
      "note": "两侧的空白集合显式列出（ASCII 空白加 U+00A0、U+3000），制表符在其中"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"shop://product/42\"",
      "hit": true,
      "url": "shop://product/42",
      "note": "任意 scheme 都命中；网页目标上由 handler 记 error"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"HTTPS://EXAMPLE.COM/\"",
      "hit": true,
      "url": "HTTPS://EXAMPLE.COM/"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"https://example.com",
      "hit": true,
      "url": "https://example.com",
      "note": "引号不配对：模式命中，handler 记 error"
    },
    {
      "text": "https://example.com\"",
      "hit": true,
      "url": "https://example.com",
      "note": "引号不配对：模式命中，handler 记 error"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"https://example.com/.\"",
      "hit": true,
      "url": "https://example.com/.",
      "note": "引号内一律原样当地址，末尾标点不剥"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foo_(bar)\"",
      "hit": true,
      "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foo_(bar)"
    },
    {
      "text": "https://example.com/?q=1",
      "hit": true,
      "url": "https://example.com/?q=1",
      "note": "问号在中间不算末尾标点"
    },
    {
      "text": "https://ab.example/",
      "hit": true,
      "url": "https://ab.example/",
      "note": "U+0085 只在 Python 的 \\s 里；两侧都不当空白"
    },
    {
      "text": "https://example.com/　",
      "hit": true,
      "url": "https://example.com/",
      "note": "行尾多一个全角空格：当空白剥去"
    },
    {
      "text": " \"https://example.com/\"",
      "hit": true,
      "url": "https://example.com/",
      "note": "不换行空格当空白剥去"
    },
    {
      "text": "https://a　b.example/",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "地址中间的全角空格：含空白，不是地址"
    },
    {
      "text": "https://example.com/．",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "不带引号、末尾全角句点"
    },
    {
      "text": "https://example.com/］",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "不带引号、末尾全角右方括号"
    },
    {
      "text": "https://example.com/…",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "不带引号、末尾省略号"
    },
    {
      "text": "https://example.com/”",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "不带引号、末尾右双引号"
    },
    {
      "text": "https://example.com/﻿",
      "hit": true,
      "url": "https://example.com/﻿",
      "note": "末尾 BOM 不是空白也不是标点：两侧都命中并进地址（只有开头的 BOM 挡住整句）"
    },
    {
      "text": "打开 \"https://example.com/\"",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "1.4 的旧写法，整句交给 AI"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"https://example.com/\"。",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "引号外的标点：不剥标点"
    },
    {
      "text": "https://example.com/。",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "不带引号、末尾句号：不是整句一个地址"
    },
    {
      "text": "https://example.com/.",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "不带引号、末尾 ASCII 句号"
    },
    {
      "text": "https://example.com/)",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "不带引号、末尾右括号"
    },
    {
      "text": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foo_(bar)",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "地址本身以括号结尾：不带引号时走 AI，要导航就加引号"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"https://example.com/.",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "引号不配对且末尾标点：不命中、走 AI"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"https://example.com/\" \"https://example.org/\"",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "两个地址不是整句一个地址"
    },
    {
      "text": "tel:123",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "没有 ://"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"https://example.com/a b\"",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "含未编码空格"
    },
    {
      "text": "'https://example.com/'",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "单引号不是地址的一部分"
    },
    {
      "text": "﻿https://example.com/",
      "hit": false,
      "note": "BOM 不算空白（JS 的 \\s 含它、Python 的不含）：两侧都不命中"
    },
    {
      "text": "首页",
      "hit": false
    }
  ],
  "registry": {
    "entries": [
      {
        "pattern": "<NAV>",
        "description": "nav",
        "example": "Given \"https://x.example/\"",
        "keywords": [
          "Given",
          "When"
        ]
      },
      {
        "pattern": "仅给定 \"(?P<x>[^\"]+)\"",
        "description": "d1",
        "example": "Given 仅给定 \"a\"",
        "keywords": [
          "When",
          "Given"
        ]
      },
      {
        "pattern": "任意关键字",
        "description": "d2",
        "example": "Then 任意关键字"
      },
      {
        "pattern": "https?://conflict\\.example(?P<rest>[^\"]*)",
        "description": "d3",
        "example": "Given https://conflict.example/"
      }
    ],
    "expected_keywords": [
      [
        "Given",
        "When"
      ],
      [
        "Given",
        "When"
      ],
      [
        "Given",
        "When",
        "Then"
      ],
      [
        "Given",
        "When",
        "Then"
      ]
    ],
    "probes": [
      {
        "keyword": "Given",
        "text": "仅给定 \"a\"",
        "expect": {
          "pattern": "仅给定 \"(?P<x>[^\"]+)\"",
          "description": "d1"
        }
      },
      {
        "keyword": "When",
        "text": "仅给定 \"a\"",
        "expect": {
          "pattern": "仅给定 \"(?P<x>[^\"]+)\"",
          "description": "d1"
        }
      },
      {
        "keyword": "Then",
        "text": "仅给定 \"a\"",
        "expect": {
          "keyword_mismatch": "仅给定 \"(?P<x>[^\"]+)\"",
          "keywords": [
            "Given",
            "When"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "keyword": "Then",
        "text": "任意关键字",
        "expect": {
          "pattern": "任意关键字",
          "description": "d2"
        }
      },
      {
        "keyword": "Given",
        "text": "\"https://x.example/\"",
        "expect": {
          "pattern": "<NAV>",
          "description": "nav"
        }
      },
      {
        "keyword": "When",
        "text": "https://x.example/",
        "expect": {
          "pattern": "<NAV>",
          "description": "nav"
        }
      },
      {
        "keyword": "Then",
        "text": "\"https://x.example/\"",
        "expect": {
          "keyword_mismatch": "<NAV>",
          "keywords": [
            "Given",
            "When"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "\"https://x.example/\"",
        "expect": {
          "pattern": "<NAV>",
          "description": "nav"
        },
        "note": "裸字符串形态不核关键字"
      },
      {
        "keyword": null,
        "text": "仅给定 \"a\"",
        "expect": {
          "pattern": "仅给定 \"(?P<x>[^\"]+)\"",
          "description": "d1"
        },
        "note": "keyword 为 null 与缺键同义、不核关键字"
      },
      {
        "keyword": "Given",
        "text": "https://conflict.example/a",
        "expect": {
          "conflict": [
            "<NAV>",
            "https?://conflict\\.example(?P<rest>[^\"]*)"
          ]
        },
        "note": "使用方的宽模式也匹配裸地址：按冲突规则报、不做覆盖"
      },
      {
        "keyword": "When",
        "text": "没有这条",
        "expect": null
      }
    ]
  }
}
